														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3852748">
									

<p>I enjoyed this. Just a sad robot man who's planning on quitting and doesn't realise he's already been prevented from doing so. Kind of reminds me of my one big fear in a subdued kind of way.</p>
<p>I have a couple of questions, primarily stemming from this line:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The entity does not require either food or water, and has shown to be capable of surviving in highly toxic, low-oxygen environments.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>1: It's powered by a steam engine, so surely that implies it actually <em>does</em> need water?<br />
2: When or how was it shown to have been able to survive toxic environments, if they have never moved it out of its little house?</p>
<p>I noticed a couple of minor issues (a repeated &quot;the&quot; and a missing full stop) which I took the liberty of correcting, hope that's ok.</p>
<p>In any case, +1 from me.</p>

							</div>

								
					
